<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Physicians Corp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Physicians Corp raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Robert Hoehn said he raised his rating on Physicians Corp of America.</p>
<p>-- &quot;A combination of rising commercial premium rates, capitated arrangements with providers, and the sale of money-losing operations is expected to result in a return to profitability,&quot; Hoehn said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 1/2 at 12-1/4 toward midday.</p>
</text>
